From 655281735b0ec464dca02a3b5d2b646a7bb5f522 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 04:57:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] add libmaxminddb's attribution notice next to the package's
 own licence

The extension statically compiles the bundled libmaxminddb sources
(extension/libmaxminddb/src/maxminddb.c and data-pool.c, plus its
headers), so every binary wheel is a redistribution of libmaxminddb.
libmaxminddb is Apache-2.0 and ships a NOTICE file, and section 4(d) of
that licence requires the attribution notices in it to travel with any
derivative work that is redistributed. The built wheel carries only
maxminddb's own LICENSE, which is the unmodified Apache-2.0 boilerplate
with the copyright placeholder left unfilled, so no attribution reaches
the user at all.

Adding the file is enough on its own: setuptools' default license_files
glob (LICEN[CS]E*, COPYING*, NOTICE*, AUTHORS* at the project root) picks
it up, so it lands in the wheel's dist-info/licenses/ next to LICENSE with
no packaging change.

Upstream-Status: To upstream [the same gap exists in every maxminddb wheel on PyPI for every platform, so it needs a maintainer discussion rather than a drive-by PR]
Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 NOTICE | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 NOTICE

diff --git a/NOTICE b/NOTICE
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..df16197
--- /dev/null
+++ b/NOTICE
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+Copyright 2013-2026 MaxMind, Inc.
+
+Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License");
+you may not use this file except in compliance with the License.
+You may obtain a copy of the License at
+
+    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
+
+Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software
+distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS,
+WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.
+See the License for the specific language governing permissions and
+limitations under the License.
